{"source":["FAT32 \n  + Compatible everywhere.\n  -  Cannot handle files larger than 4GB.\n\nexFAT\n  + Compatible almost everywhere.\n  + Can handle files larger than 4GB.\n  -  Not as compatible as FAT32.\n\nNTFS \n  + Compatible with Windows.\n  -  Not compatible with Mac and most hardware devices.\n  -  Occasional compatibility problems with Linux (NTFS is proprietary and reverse engineered).\n\nEXT4 \n  + Modern, stable, fast, journalized.\n  + Supports Linux file permissions.\n  -  Not compatible with Windows, Mac and most hardware devices.\n"],"target":["FAT32 \n  + Kompatibelt överallt.\n  - Kan inte hantera filer som är större än 4 GB.\n\nexFAT\n  + Kompatibelt nästan överallt.\n  + Kan hantera filer som är större än 4 GB.\n  - Inte lika kompatibelt som FAT32.\n\nNTFS \n  + Kompatibelt med Windows.\n  - Inte kompatibelt med Mac och de flesta maskinvaruenheter.\n  - Ibland kompatibilitetsproblem med Linux (NTFS är proprietärt och baklängeskonstruerat).\n\nEXT4 \n  + Modernt, stabilt, snabbt och journalförande.\n  + Stöd för Linux-filrättigheter.\n  - Inte kompatibelt med Windows, Mac och de flesta maskinvaruenheter.\n"],"context":"","unit":"238","id":"ca06fb9b616b91437986ecad","project":"MintStick","component":"mintstick_sv.po","note":"Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: archive reviewed Swedish MintStick translation","publication_status":"review-commit","evidence":{"artifact":"https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/04fa4e913d87e12cd39e6c6f362cae3bf2d5a4be/MintStick/mintstick_sv.po","sha256":"6b211920e3c61a14b8893408dd236bf3feb66edb8867e64a2355d6343aba2015"},"review_commit":"04fa4e913d87e12cd39e6c6f362cae3bf2d5a4be"}
